{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46819","headline":"荆门病中寄怀乡人欧阳侍郎彬 · 齐己","name":"荆门病中寄怀乡人欧阳侍郎彬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁会荆州一老夫，梦劳神役忆匡庐。\n碧云雁影纷纷去，黄叶蟾声渐渐无。\n口淡莫分餐气味，身羸但觉病肌肤。\n可怜馔玉烧兰者，肯慰寒偎雪夜炉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}